      "content": "TL 0902             ABBOTS LANGLEY         HIGH STREET                                            (Southeast side)                                            Abbots Langley 11/40                                      No. 15 GV                                         II House. Early C19, altered C20. Stuccoed brick. Tiled roof. 2 storeys. 3 window front.  Central entrance with rectangular fanlight in reveal. Reeded pilasters to bracketed hood. C20 2 light casements. Blind opening to first floor centre. Ground floor right double doors to carriageway. Left end stack, Wing extending to rear right. Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL0954002171"
    }
